      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, what do you mean by \"a goblin's mood\" or \"like a goblin's heavy armor\"? I'm just looking for the science behind the microbial ratios and the enzymatic activity. Can you just stick to the chemistry of the flour protein and how it affects the buffering capacity of the dough?",
